      **Skills** Athletics rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Athletics Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The ape makes two Fist attacks.

      ***Fist.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Fist]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Fist]) Bludgeoning damage.

      ***Rock (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Rock])).*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rock]), range 25/50 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rock]) Bludgeoning damage.

